 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Two hundred \"tests\", each one is green;",
   "section": "Opening",
   "start": 3.03,
   "end": 7.43,
   "couplet": 1,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "The finest score you've ever seen!",
   "section": "Opening",
   "start": 7.848,
   "end": 14.507,
   "couplet": 1,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "My \"tests\"? I paste app code in haste\u2014",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 15.314,
   "end": 17.763,
   "couplet": 2,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "A perfect duplication!",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 18.007,
   "end": 19.865,
   "couplet": 2,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "The sums agree! How sweet for me!",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 20.149,
   "end": 22.591,
   "couplet": 3,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "(A shared miscalculation.)",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 22.599,
   "end": 24.613,
   "couplet": 3,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "With screenshots, commas cause such dramas:",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 24.909,
   "end": 27.49,
   "couplet": 4,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "A red notification.",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 27.498,
   "end": 29.719,
   "couplet": 4,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "My \"test\"? Fantastic, automatic\u2014",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 29.727,
   "end": 32.39,
   "couplet": 5,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "I change its expectation!",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 32.398,
   "end": 34.406,
   "couplet": 5,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "To boost my score, I cover more;",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 34.656,
   "end": 37.086,
   "couplet": 6,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "They've trained me just to make the grade.",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 37.094,
   "end": 39.044,
   "couplet": 6,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Like kids in class, I aim to pass;",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 39.52,
   "end": 41.906,
   "couplet": 7,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "The marks decide how tests get made.",
   "section": "Verse 1",
   "start": 42.063,
   "end": 44.046,
   "couplet": 7,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Did you actually test it?",
   "section": "Refrain 1",
   "start": 44.054,
   "end": 46.391,
   "couplet": 8,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Press it, stress it, second-guess it!",
   "section": "Refrain 1",
   "start": 46.399,
   "end": 48.588,
   "couplet": 8,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Find a clue? Congratulations!",
   "section": "Refrain 1",
   "start": 48.779,
   "end": 51.262,
   "couplet": 9,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Now pursue its implications.",
   "section": "Refrain 1",
   "start": 51.27,
   "end": 53.423,
   "couplet": 9,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "What did you try? What did you find?",
   "section": "Refrain 1",
   "start": 53.638,
   "end": 57.974,
   "couplet": 10,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "What changed your mind?",
   "section": "Refrain 1",
   "start": 58.149,
   "end": 60.61,
   "couplet": 10,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "The gym? No net. We log a set;",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 63.826,
   "end": 65.788,
   "couplet": 11,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "The app says \"Saved!\"\u2014 but what's in store?",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 66.24,
   "end": 68.481,
   "couplet": 11,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Reload the screen; no set is seen.",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 68.683,
   "end": 70.912,
   "couplet": 12,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Connect once more: still gone? Explore!",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 70.92,
   "end": 73.361,
   "couplet": 12,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "We chase the clue; try something new:",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 73.369,
   "end": 75.697,
   "couplet": 13,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Connect, then save; the sets all stay.",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 75.947,
   "end": 78.214,
   "couplet": 13,
   "line_in_couplet": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "We drop the net, then save a set;",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 78.222,
   "end": 80.463,
   "couplet": 14,
   "line_in_couplet": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "A new check flags what went away.",
   "section": "Verse 2",
   "start": 80.858,
   "end": 82.992,
   "couplet": 14,
